EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. In order to access services on My ASU, including checking the status of your application, you must have your ASURITE UserID and activation code. Please allow two hours to pass before activating your ASURITE UserID.

Please follow the instructions on the ASURITE activation webpage: https://asu.edu/asurite. If you have further questions, please contact Admission Services at 480-965-7788.

Your ASURITE UserID is: {!Contact.ASURite_ID__c}
Your activation code is: (INSERT CODE HERE)

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
